Package: vhdx-mount
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, qemu-utils, ntfs-3g, zenity | kdialog, python3, python3-tk
Description: Mount VHDX virtual disk files with one click
 VHDX Mount Tool makes it easy to mount and access VHDX (Virtual Hard Disk)
 files on Linux with just a single click.
 .
 Features:
  - One-click mounting via double-click or right-click context menu
  - Automatic partition detection and mounting
  - Full NTFS filesystem support for Windows VHDX files
  - Desktop notifications for mount/unmount operations
  - Integration with all major Linux file managers
  - Optional passwordless mounting for seamless operation
 .
 Simply double-click any .vhdx file in your file manager to mount it.
